      g: "Elastic IPs are static public addresses and have no effect on hardware placement.",
      h: "Capacity Reservations reserve capacity in an AZ; they do not spread instances across separate racks.",
      i: "Partitions never share racks, so placing each replica in its own partition keeps a single rack's power or network failure from affecting more than one replica.",
