    explanation: "Parameter Store, a capability of AWS Systems Manager, provides secure, hierarchical storage for configuration data and secrets. Standard parameters are free, and values can be referenced from CloudFormation, Lambda, and EC2 user data. For secrets needing automatic rotation, AWS Secrets Manager is the complementary choice.",
