      g: "DataSync transfers files to AWS; it does not inventory servers or map application dependencies.",
      h: "Inspector scans EC2, Lambda, and container images for vulnerabilities; it is not a discovery and dependency mapping tool.",
      i: "AWS Transform, which AWS now recommends in place of Application Discovery Service, discovers on-premises servers, collects utilization and network connections, and builds migration wave plans.",
