    text: "A company runs 40 Windows and Linux servers in its own data center. It needs a disaster recovery solution that continuously replicates those servers to AWS so that, after an outage, it can launch fully functional copies in AWS within minutes, while paying only for low-cost staging resources during normal operation. Which AWS service is designed for this?",
