    text: "A company built a customer support chatbot on a foundation model in Amazon Bedrock. The model sometimes gives generic or outdated answers because it has no knowledge of the company's internal product manuals stored in Amazon S3. The company wants the model's responses to be grounded in those documents using retrieval augmented generation (RAG) without training a custom model. Which Bedrock capability should it use?",
