    correctOptionIds: ["a", "i"],
    answerType: "single",
    explanation: "Amazon Bedrock Knowledge Bases implement the full RAG workflow: they ingest documents from sources such as Amazon S3, convert them into embeddings stored in a vector store, retrieve the most relevant passages at query time, and augment the model prompt with that context so responses cite current, company-specific information.",
