    text: "A team launches Amazon EC2 instances from a standard Amazon Linux AMI. Each new instance must automatically install a web server, pull the latest application build, and register with a monitoring agent the first time it boots, without an administrator connecting to it. Which EC2 feature should the team use to achieve this?",
