      g: "The /tmp directory is ephemeral and is not guaranteed to persist between execution environments.",
      h: "Lambda memory can be configured from 128 MB up to 10,240 MB.",
      i: "Besides zip archives, Lambda accepts container images up to 10 GB, which helps with image-processing libraries that are large.",
      j: "Provisioned concurrency pre-initializes a set number of execution environments so requests avoid cold-start delays.",
