    text: "An operations team wants to detect that its public checkout page is broken before customers report it. It needs scripted checks that load the page from AWS every five minutes, follow the login and add-to-cart flow, capture screenshots, and raise an alarm when a step fails. Which Amazon CloudWatch feature provides this?",
