    correctOptionIds: ["a", "i"],
    answerType: "single",
    explanation: "CloudWatch Synthetics canaries are configurable Node.js or Python scripts that run on a schedule to monitor endpoints and UI workflows from the outside, the same way a customer would. They record availability, latency, screenshots, and HAR files, and publish metrics that you can alarm on, so broken pages are detected proactively.",
