    text: "A developer is building a serverless application made up of Lambda functions, an API Gateway REST API, and a DynamoDB table. They want a shorthand infrastructure-as-code syntax that expands into a standard AWS CloudFormation stack, along with a CLI to build, test functions locally, and deploy. Which AWS tool matches this description?",
