    text: "A company has several Java and .NET applications running on virtual machines in its data center, with each application's source code stored in GitHub. It wants to containerize them and run them on Amazon ECS or EKS but has no container expertise and does not want to hand-write Dockerfiles for each application. Which AWS tool automates this?",
