      h: "A connection in a different Region at another facility is a valid resilient design but far more costly than a VPN failover, which the question asks for.",
      i: "Correct. An IPsec Site-to-Site VPN costs little, and BGP route preference keeps Direct Connect primary while the VPN takes over if the dedicated link fails.",
