    text: "An application writes log lines such as \"ERROR PaymentTimeout\" to Amazon CloudWatch Logs. The operations team wants a CloudWatch alarm to fire when more than 20 such lines appear within five minutes. Which CloudWatch capability turns matching log events into a numeric value that an alarm can evaluate?",
