    text: "An online marketplace is losing money to fake accounts that attackers create in bulk, often with stolen credentials, to abuse sign-up bonuses. It wants a managed AWS capability that inspects every request to its account sign-up page in real time and labels or blocks suspicious account creation attempts, without the team building machine learning models. Which AWS capability should it use?",
