      f: "Rekognition analyzes images and video.",
      g: "Detective investigates security findings; it is not for transaction fraud.",
      h: "Correct. AWS WAF Fraud Control's account creation fraud prevention (ACFP) managed rule group uses request identifiers, behavioral analysis, and machine learning to detect and block fraudulent sign-ups.",
      i: "Correct. Adding the account creation fraud prevention (ACFP) rule group, AWSManagedRulesACFPRuleSet, to the web ACL protecting the sign-up page labels and blocks suspicious account creation attempts in real time, with no models to build.",
