    text: "An e-commerce company wants to know that its checkout page is working for customers even at 3 a.m. when there is no real traffic. It wants a scripted, headless browser to load the page and complete a test purchase flow every five minutes from AWS, and to raise a CloudWatch alarm if the flow fails or becomes slow. Which capability provides this?",
