    text: "A network engineer is troubleshooting why an application in a private subnet cannot reach a database in another subnet, and the security team also wants a record of all accepted and rejected IP traffic to and from the network interfaces in the VPC for later analysis in CloudWatch Logs or Amazon S3. Which VPC feature provides this information?",
