    text: "A media company stores millions of user-generated images in Amazon S3. Some images are viewed thousands of times a day while others are never opened again after upload, and the company cannot predict which is which. It wants to reduce storage costs automatically without any retrieval fees or performance impact when an old image suddenly becomes popular, and without writing lifecycle rules. Which S3 storage class should it choose?",
