    text: "A research institute hosts a 300 TB public satellite imagery dataset in Amazon S3. Thousands of external organizations download terabytes each month, and the institute's data transfer bill has become unsustainable. The institute wants to keep the data in S3 and available to anyone with an AWS account, but have each downloader pay the request and data transfer charges for what they retrieve. Which S3 feature accomplishes this?",
