    explanation: "DynamoDB Accelerator (DAX) is a fully managed, in-memory cache that is API-compatible with DynamoDB, so applications get microsecond read latency for repeated reads by switching the client endpoint rather than rewriting data access code. ElastiCache or MemoryDB could also cache the data, but they require the application to manage cache population and invalidation itself.",
