    explanation: "AWS X-Ray, also surfaced in CloudWatch Application Signals, collects trace data as a request passes through API Gateway, Lambda, ECS, and DynamoDB, then renders a service map and per-segment timings so you can pinpoint where latency or errors occur. Metrics and logs show what each service did individually; distributed tracing connects them into one request timeline.",
