    answerType: "single",
    explanation: "SageMaker JumpStart is a machine learning hub that provides hundreds of pre-trained, open-source and proprietary foundation and task-specific models, plus solution templates and example notebooks. You can deploy a model to a SageMaker endpoint with a few clicks or fine-tune it on your own dataset, and everything runs in your account. Ground Truth labels data, Model Monitor watches deployed models for drift, and Feature Store manages features; none of them supply ready-to-deploy models.",
