    explanation: "Amazon WorkSpaces Secure Browser (formerly WorkSpaces Web) provides low-cost, managed, isolated browser sessions that stream to the user's own browser. Users authenticate through a SAML identity provider, browse internal websites and SaaS applications through a VPC connection, and only pixels are sent to the endpoint device, so no data lands on the laptop and no client is installed. WorkSpaces Personal delivers full persistent desktops, and WorkSpaces Applications streams whole applications, which is more than this use case needs.",
