      e: "Discovery Service inventories servers and dependencies for planning; it does not migrate them.",
      f: "App2Container containerizes applications rather than rehosting whole servers.",
      g: "VM Import/Export uploads a static VM image and does not offer continuous replication or test launches.",
      h: "Migration Hub tracks progress across migration tools but does not replicate servers.",
      i: "Correct. AWS MGN replication agents keep the servers continuously replicated to AWS, allowing test launches and a cutover of minutes.",
